{"unit_id":"wucl12__dsh-side-branch#feature-quote","repo":"wucl12/dsh-side-branch","commit":"7507d9cb5d57d6a76f7b310c3525978f38d53aed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-branch 的功能「引用选中文字提问」：用户在主会话中选中文字后点击浮动入口，插件把引用送入侧枝面板作为问题上下文；该问答保留在独立分支中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3382-3390","lib/index.js:1187-1197"]}
{"unit_id":"wucl12__dsh-side-branch#feature-branch","repo":"wucl12/dsh-side-branch","commit":"7507d9cb5d57d6a76f7b310c3525978f38d53aed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-branch 的功能「同步主会话已完成回合」：每次创建或重建侧枝时，插件从主会话事件中取最后一个已完成回合之前的内容作为种子，并保留侧枝自己的问答历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1139-1159"]}
{"unit_id":"wucl12__dsh-side-branch#feature-models","repo":"wucl12/dsh-side-branch","commit":"7507d9cb5d57d6a76f7b310c3525978f38d53aed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-branch 的功能「为侧枝单独选模型」：面板提供模型和 reasoning effort 选择；发送时将所选项交给宿主，未指定模型时则跟随主会话当前模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2502-2519","lib/client.js:3670-3680"]}
